+# NPC and Risk Terminal regression tests
+
+After the admin app's normal dependency installation, run from its root:
+
+```sh
+npm run test:regression:npc-risk
+```
+
+Equivalent command:
+
+```sh
+node --test tests/npc-risk-regression.test.cjs
+```
+
+These 16 tests read this checkout's actual Risk Terminal selection callback, socket hook, NPC status callback and status helper. They use the Babel dependency already supplied by `@vitejs/plugin-react` to parse source; they do not add a new package. In-memory React/socket/timer doubles exercise disconnect fallback, stale tick expiry, round changes, cleanup, and enabled-versus-running status.
+
+They do not mount a full browser DOM or contact a service. Keep browser and full-stack tests in addition to these source-level regressions. No model, application server, credentials or external fixture folders are required.
